{"id": "22-3771-2-2", "zh": "昨日时（hiyyattanī）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3772-2-5", "zh": "下面讲昨日时。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-3773-2-47", "zh": "584. 用于非今日的过去：ā、ū、o、ttha、a、mhā、ttha、tthuṃ、se、vhaṃ、iṃ、mhase。[ka.418；rū.456；nī.886；caṃ.1.2.77；pā.3.2.111]", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3774-2-10", "zh": "在今天以外的过去时间里，ā 等语尾加在表示动作的词根之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3775-2-22", "zh": "585. 在 ā 等、ī 等、ssā 等语尾的场合，可以加 a（au）。[ka.519；rū.457；nī.1032]", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3776-2-11", "zh": "在 ā 等、ī 等、ssā 等语尾的场合，可以在这些词的开头加 a。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3777-2-31", "zh": "他 abhavā、bhavā，他们 abhavū、bhavū，你 abhavo、bhavo，你们 abhavattha、bhavattha，我 abhava、bhava，我们 abhavamhā、bhavamhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3778-2-25", "zh": "在后一组语尾中：abhavattha、bhavattha，abhavatthuṃ、bhavatthuṃ，abhavase、bhavase，abhavavhaṃ、bhavavhaṃ，abhaviṃ、bhaviṃ，abhavamhase、bhavamhase。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3779-2-26", "zh": "586. ā、ī、ū、mhā、ssā、ssāmha 可以变为短音。[ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105]", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-3780-2-6", "zh": "这些语尾可以变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-3781-2-10", "zh": "他 abhava，他们 abhavu，我们 abhavamha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-3782-2-35", "zh": "按照“eyyāthasse”等规则，ā 变为 ttha，a 变为 aṃ：他 abhavattha、bhavattha，或者 abhavā、bhavā；我 abhavaṃ、bhavaṃ，或者 abhava、bhava。这些是单纯的主动形式。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-3783-2-77", "zh": "这里，按照大通则（mahāvutti），常常可以看到 ā 语尾被替换为 tha，例如：medanī sampakampatha（大地震动了）[jā.2.22.1672]，visaññī samapajjatha（他失去了知觉）[jā.2.22.328]，imā gāthā abhāsatha（他说了这些偈颂）[jā.2.22.328]，tuccho kāyo adissatha（身体显得空虚）[theragā.172]，nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha（厌离生起了）[theragā.273]，eko rahasi jhāyatha（他独自在静处禅修）[jā.1.15.286]，等等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-3783-78-86", "zh": "o 语尾也是这样，例如：dubbheyyaṃ maṃ amaññatha（你以为我会背叛），等等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-3784-2-4", "zh": "昨日时到此结束。", "confidence": 85}
